## Optional privacy gate (do not fail the suite)

Some orgs **skip** the data-privacy screen and open the **main DAL setup form** directly (`new-data-activation-layer-modal-setup2.html` pattern).

- Flow JSON: **`optional: true`** on **`DAL Lytics doc: Data privacy confirmation checkbox (doc step)`** and **`DAL Lytics doc: Proceed button label (doc step)`**.
- **`DAL Lytics doc: Proceed button after privacy confirmation (doc step)`** stays required; `actionRules` **no-ops** when `.lytics-consent-modal` is absent and waits for **`[data-test-id="cs-org-lytics-tag-name"]`** instead.

